      "guidance": "Original integration guidance: Use small, meaningful confirmation or progress accents rather than motion as the only status signal. Supply your own licensed local animation JSON; this archive contains code reference text, not playable Lottie data. Honor live prefers-reduced-motion changes by pausing and showing a useful still frame. Avoid perpetual decorative loops, pause offscreen players, and destroy instances on teardown. Renderer choice affects browser cost and fidelity; profile complex masks and oversized compositions.",
